WEBVTT

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.140
Hey, hey, Nishi! Pick up the pace!

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.240
You won't get anything out of training if you keep dawdling like that!

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.850
That's easy for you to say...

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:12.750
But I'm just too hungry...

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.500
I said, come on!

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:21.610
Don't yell at me... I know that!

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.870
Now, before we cool down too much,

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.480
we should go finish up our training.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.940
Hey, you hear me, Nishi? Get in the gym!

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.080
You hear me?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.180
Yeah, I hear you!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:37.110
Joe, I can stop if it hurts too much.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.680
Just shut your mouth and keep going, dumbass!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.270
It's been so long since our last matches that we're starting to get weak!

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.120
I ain't gonna let you hold back on me!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.590
Then here I go.

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:48.660
Hurry it up!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.430
Hold it! Hold it, Nishi!

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:14.940
J-Joe! A-Are you all right?

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.610
H-Hey, Nishi. Something's wrong.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.610
What's wrong?

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:25.070
Are you really under the middleweight limit?

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.580
You feel like a light heavyweight... Maybe even a heavyweight!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.050
Don't be silly!

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.960
I'm keeping myself within the middleweight limits!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.590
No, you look like a heavyweight to me, too.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.480
Welcome back, old man!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.090
Hey. Welcome home, old man.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.310
Hey.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:52.220
Now, Nishi. I know I'm strictly regulating your water and food,

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.710
so what's going on here?

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.100
What do you mean?

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:58.610
I'm talking about your weight.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.780
What're you talking about, old man?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.570
There ain't no problem with my weight!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:07.070
If there's something wrong, it's that my body won't slim out.

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:10.580
You don't have to go assuming things, old man!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.340
I see. Then it's fine.

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.370
You're such a worrywart, old man!

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.750
I said it's fine, Nishi!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:20.800
Right.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.490
What are you just standing there for, you two!?

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:35.980
The bell hasn't rung yet!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.440
Keep practicing!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.800
Nishi, get to jump roping! Joe, work on the speed bag!

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.010
Now!

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:41.650
Got it!

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.030
Start already, dammit!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:47.740
Yes!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.700
He sure is strict...

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:10.140
Joe, I got called into the executive office today.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:16.390
You saw the boxing commissioner?

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.540
So what'd he want?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.990
It seems Shiraki Gym has filed a formal request for a match.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.620
You mean the Joe-Rikiishi match?

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:33.870
The commissioner said he wanted me to accept the request.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.910
So you accepted, didn't you, old man?

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:42.130
Shut up! Get back to practicing!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.180
All right, already!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:55.060
It rang!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.560
It rang! Practice is over for today!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.560
Hey, Joe! That's enough! The bell rang!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.320
So, you accepted it?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.570
So, you accepted it?

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.020
Yeah...

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.540
I accepted.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.330
After I stopped by Shiraki Gym,

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.240
I couldn't help but accept.

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:28.590
I couldn't help but accept when I saw Rikiishi-kun.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.590
You met Rikiishi?

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:33.680
Yeah, I did.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.850
But he wasn't the same man.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:36.960
What?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.960
<i>How many more minutes?</i>

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:09.970
<i>One minute.</i>

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.290
<i>Ten more seconds...</i>

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:21.980
<i>Nine seconds...</i>

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.320
<i>Eight seconds...</i>

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.270
<i>Seven seconds...</i>

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.270
<i>Six seconds...</i>

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.100
<i>Five seconds...</i>

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:26.980
<i>Four seconds...</i>

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.080
<i>Three seconds...</i>

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:28.490
<i>Two seconds...</i>

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:29.900
<i>One second...</i>

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.490
<i>Now...</i>

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.410
<i>That's enough, Rikiishi-kun.</i>

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.890
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:58.930
<i>No problem.</i>

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.430
<i>It's been a while.</i>

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.900
<i>He's such a hard worker...</i>

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:12.490
<i>so I have to keep it up myself.</i>

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.750
<i>Now pardon me.</i>

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.750
<i>Rikiishi-kun!</i>

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:36.260
He was sweating in a steam bath that was over seventy degrees...

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:43.270
Then Rikiishi-kun started violently shadow boxing

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:47.510
in a training room filled with boiling kettles!

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.940
His face looked like a demon mask.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:30.150
How could I have refused?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:36.210
I tried telling myself over and over, "This fight is immature," and "This fight is absurd,"

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:41.080
but, when I saw Rikiishi-kun's intensity, I had to take him more seriously.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:46.160
He sweats off in the steam bath twice a day,

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.120
and he does intense training on top of that.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:53.130
And he barely eats anything but a hint of fruit!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.880
No ordinary human could go that far!

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:03.830
So, old man...

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.390
What day's the match?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.460
That hasn't been decided yet,

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:10.950
but I told the commissioner to hold it as soon as possible.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.480
Rikiishi-kun has too large a frame.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:17.910
He can't shed pounds and stay in the bantamweight class for very long.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.580
I get it.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.320
Well, that's convenient.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.910
I'm even ready to fight him tonight!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.910
Joe!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.340
And besides...

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.110
I feel sorry for the fact that he's barely eating or drinking.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:04.700
It's time to eat, Rikiishi-kun.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.740
Eat?

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.250
Yes.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.530
What the hell? You're eating a pork cutlet on rice after a big bowl of ramen?

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.220
My match just finished yesterday.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:52.620
This pork cutlet's gonna make up for all that harsh weight loss before my-

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.250
What was that for?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.870
Hey, you got a meal ticket?

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.900
It's Rikiishi.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:17.780
Get me the usual.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.780
Oh... Pardon my rudeness...

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.510
Hey, Joe. Give me your plate.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.860
That smell's just tantalizing!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.830
You give me your plate too, Nishi.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.410
Yes! Yes, yes!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.460
Uh, is that all?

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:17.460
What?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.800
Oh, uh, it's nothin'.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:27.220
Well, you can't fight on an empty stomach! Time to chow down!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:34.270
Not eating, Joe?

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:52.490
That was delicious!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.410
Your cooking's first-rate as always, old man!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:00.840
The smell and the taste are just perfect!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.550
Once you've eaten your portion, go to sleep!

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.550
O-Okay.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:09.620
Honestly...

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:13.180
And Rikiishi's making do with just a tomato a day...

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.680
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:18.680
This is just insane!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.690
Thanks for the food.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.990
I'm going to sleep.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:36.980
Hey, Joe! What's the matter? You're not even finished!

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:39.790
I have to start watching my weight to prepare for the match.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:40.600
Good night.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:57.850
Nishi.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:58.760
Yes?

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.280
You go sleep, too.

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:06.980
The best way to lose weight is to lie still without fretting too much.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:07.690
Yeah...

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.630
Well, I'm going to bed too, old man.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.350
Good night.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.020
Rikiishi and Joe...

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:28.930
I would have stopped them from fighting if I could,

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:32.850
so that neither of the two excellent boxers would be injured.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:36.700
But there's nothing I can do anymore.

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:38.480
Rikiishi and Joe...

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:42.660
Those two have set up a harsh world of battle between themselves

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:46.090
which has no room for me.{re-edited}

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.750
I see.

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:26.410
So you've finally come down to my level, Rikiishi.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:28.920
You know, Rikiishi...

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:33.410
I was planning on gaining weight after my match with Wolf.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.990
But you came down instead.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.480
But...

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:43.300
Whether we're in the world of juvie, or the world of pro boxing...

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:45.110
You've always been ahead of me.

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:50.180
So it's only natural that you'd be the one to match with me.

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:51.960
Isn't that right, Rikiishi?

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:55.480
But you know, Rikiishi...

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:59.890
If this weight loss causes you to lose...

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.930
you can just go back to being a featherweight.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.920
And when you do...

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:08.050
I'll make my way up to the featherweight class and challenge you to a rematch!

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:11.870
Then neither of us will have anything against each other.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.310
Welcome back, sir!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:40.320
O-Old man, get me two large bowls of udon!

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.780
Sure! Thanks for your business!

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.140
Make it quick, old man!

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:52.790
I just can't resist the smell!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.800
Order up!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.510
Th-Thanks!

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:22.040
Hey, Nishi. I wondered where you were sneaking off to.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:24.240
Having a little midnight snack, are we?

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:26.410
J-Joe!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.920
Welcome! Can I get you anything, sir?

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.260
No, I don't need any.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.380
I just wanted to know, does this man come here often?

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:42.420
Yes, quite often, always at about this time o' night...

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.440
I see.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.720
Quite often, huh?

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.610
I never wanted to see this, Nishi.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.610
You're unsightly. You're shameful!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.780
Aren't you, Nishi?

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:51.810
You've sunk even lower than low!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:54.820
You're not even part of the world of boxing where Rikiishi and I live!

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:04.240
I didn't want to see this.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:05.860
I wanted to trust you.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.770
If you drink just once... If you eat just once...

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:16.770
It'll only make the weight loss all the more unbearable!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:19.410
The old man told me that once...

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.780
You're right! I'm a failure!

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:25.400
Yeah, you're a failure! You're scum!

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:29.410
You should be ashamed! Very ashamed!

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.280
I won't give in.

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:39.020
Rikiishi must be bearing with the pain.

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:04.680
You know, Rikiishi...

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:08.740
I think the world of boxing is all about perseverance.

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:12.740
And that's the world we live in.

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.250
Isn't that right, Rikiishi?

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:53.090
In the first match of his bantamweight class conversion,

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:56.080
Rikiishi stands in the ring to face Pancho Leo.

00:23:56.080 --> 00:24:00.110
But he has a hard and agonizing fight due to his severe weight loss.

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:03.000
Now, as Joe prays for Rikiishi's victory,

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.090
which way is tomorrow!?

00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:22.270
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:22.270
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:26.110
Oira boxer

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:26.110
I am a boxer.

00:24:26.730 --> 00:24:33.860
Yuuhi ga giragira otoko no yume wa

00:24:26.730 --> 00:24:33.860
The evening sun glitters upon the dreams of men!

00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:39.370
Minna wa kono ore wo nasakemuyo to iu

00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:39.370
Everyone says that I am merciless.

00:24:39.370 --> 00:24:41.410
Tsuki ni hoete hitori

00:24:39.370 --> 00:24:41.410
Howling at the moon alone.

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:47.630
Oyanashi yadonashi no na mo nai boxer wa

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:47.630
A parentless, homeless, nameless boxer

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:50.630
Kusari wo kamikitta Yeah Yeah!

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:50.630
has bitten off his chains! Yeah, yeah!

00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:55.430
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:55.430
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:59.140
Oira boxer

00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:59.140
I am a boxer.

00:25:00.100 --> 00:25:07.400
Asahi ga noboru yo otoko no mune ni {removed the Woo, but otherwise japanese is unchanged - Reed}

00:25:00.100 --> 00:25:07.400
The morning sun rises upon the hearts of men!
